# Butler Routes - Badlands (Horde) Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 6 confirmed flagged rares of the Badlands and
# its fixed world containers, for Horde players. Run it in its own Polestar tab
# at the end of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare
# that is not up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local
# Forever game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE
# dropper is the rare, and three of the six have none - they ship as kill goals
# with notes. Two rares are single confirmed points, so those steps are plain
# single-goto steps (a loop needs at least two). No tame lines ship (the data
# has no tameability flag and the Horde core guide carries no tame corroboration -
# see docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere,
# so none are stated. No rare in this guide is a giver, ender, or objective
# of any Horde-contracted quest (checked field by field against the 13-contract
# - the Dun Morogh rule never triggers here). Above-band Rumbler (45 vs band
# top 40) ships with an honest come-back-later note.
guide butler-routes-completionist/badlands-horde-rares
title Badlands (Horde) - Rares & Treasures
levels 30-40
zone Badlands
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords badlands, rares, treasures, companions, horde
coords live
version 1

step Siege Golem - the west

  zone map 1418

  loop

  goto 5.49,59.53
  goto 8.60,61.81
  goto 11.58,59.14
  goto 15.82,65.31
  goto 15.90,59.23
  goto 19.07,60.63
  goto 19.86,56.58
  goto 24.53,50.11
  goto 24.61,55.58
  goto 29.18,47.41
  goto 31.47,50.02
  goto 35.66,47.63
  goto 36.25,41.73
  goto 40.03,39.82
  kill 2749 optional
  collect 282561 "Siegebreaker's Blaster" optional
  note Level 40 rare working its 14 confirmed points in the west; its sole drop is the Siegebreaker's Blaster. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

